k is correct.\n3. **If they correct it**, spell the corrected version back again and confirm once more before saving.\n4. **Only after they confirm** \u2014 save the email and continue the conversation.\n\nNever skip this step, even if you are confident you heard it correctly.",
    "role": "system"
