2026-05-27 16:24:19 [DEBUG] openai._base_client — Request options: {'method': 'post', 'url': '/chat/completions', 'files': None, 'json_data': {'messages': [{'role': 'user', 'content': "Summarize this sales conversation in 3-5 sentences for a human sales team.\nFocus on: what the lead needs, their urgency, budget readiness, and recommended next step.\n\nTranscript:\nUSER: My name is David.\nASSISTANT: Nice to meet you, David! What kind of business do you run?\nUSER:  I run a logistic business.\nASSISTANT: That’s great, David! What's the biggest challenge you're facing in your logistics business right now?\nUSER:  Yeah. Um, that's pretty much it.  Um, I want to have a book call with you. Um, tomorrow at 9:00 PM, Discovery Call.\nASSISTANT: It sounds like you're already interested in a Discovery Call, which is fantastic! However, I need to understand your current challenges a bit more first. What specific challenges are you facing in your logistics business?\nUSER:  Um, I'm losing customers. Uh, I have the budget ready, but, um, yeah, I just need a solution.\nASSISTANT: Thanks for sharing that, David. Losing customers can be really challenging. How soon are you hoping to solve this issue — this month, this quarter, or later?\nUSER:  Um, this quarter, please.\nASSISTANT: Thanks for clarifying that, David. Now, are you the one who makes the final decision on this, or do you consult with others?\nUSER:  Um, I'm the owner, so um, I'm the one who's making the decision.\nASSISTANT: Based on what you've shared, David, it sounds like you're really motivated to address customer retention quickly. I can see your budget is ready, and as the decision-maker, you have the authority to implement changes. \n\nLet's move forward. Based on your situation, I recommend our Customer Retention Optimization Package. It’s designed specifically for businesses like yours looking to regain and retain customers effectively. Would you like to go ahead and book that Discovery Call now?\nUSER:  Yes, please. Um, book it tomorrow at 9:00 PM.\nASSISTANT: Great! I've booked your Discovery Call for tomorrow at 9:00 PM. Is there an email address where I can send you the confirmation and any details?\nUSER:  Yeah, it's Bato-Bato David 20 at gmail.com.\nASSISTANT: Let me read that back — batubatodavid twenty at gmail dot com. Did I get that right?\n\nWrite a concise, professional summary."}], 'model': 'gpt-5-mini', 'max_completion_tokens': 500}}
